 noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>喜报 | 法学院2025-2026年度共青团宣传思想文化工作新荣誉</span></a></span></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>责编 | 郭  镁</span></p><p><span>主编<span> | 解  靖 汝美佳</span></span></p><p><span> 审核 | </span><span>许  芳 王  丹</span></p><p><span> 法学院官方微信平台出品</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/uTXmMfBfPov0EaPBl2ggDRnu2TQldNcNLD5qS7CYKVnOGOk6BAcic85Ywmaibvn6wxpq20ibGSUL4qQrG9qDBWm7Q/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp#imgIndex=9\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f9ed6532b2c89416427cf2bd1d1eae6cc2f9d8d1b12260df9bc2f8fe948ed87e","textLength":2531,"sourceSha256":"e0739c1558bab6f25ff8ace767f36e84783be0f4e0709b6f20bfcc899d1c522d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-caeedf274f3943ce1392","title":"2026年湖南师范大学法学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:48.397314+00:00"}
